TITLE Calcite kinetic dissolution at 100 C with area converted to cm2/mol
SOLUTION 1
    temp      100
    pH        5
    pe        4
    units     mmol/kgw
    C(4)      0.5
    Mn        1
KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0    1
        -m     1
        -parms 100000 0.001
        -steps 1000 in 100
        -tol   1e-12
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected2.out
    -reset false
    -time true
    -si Calcite Rhodochrosite
END
